    "text": "Share:\nBlessing of the Animals\nBlessing of the Animals, noon, St. George’s Chapel, lawns adjacent to parish hall parking lot, 20271 Beaver Dam Rd., Harbeson; All Saints' gardens next to church, 18 Olive Ave., Rehoboth. Large and small animals welcome. For more information email info@allsaintsandstgeorges.org or call 302-227-7202.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 10/25/2025 - 12:00pm",
